{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Called once per process by the integrating layer (the Appium driver, the Desktop"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Analyzer, MCP) to say who triggered this session and which product surface it came"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from. Public so those layers can call it; deliberately absent from customer docs and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not part of the supported surface."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@objc"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setUsage"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"actor"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/documentation\/axeDevToolsXCUI\/AxeUsageActor","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@axeDevToolsXCUI@E@AxeUsageActor","text":"AxeUsageActor"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"productComponent"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Whether a person or an automated run triggered the session.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"actor"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The upstream product surface, unsuffixed, e.g. ","type":"text"},{"code":"mcp","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"appium","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"name":"productComponent"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Call this before session init.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" A session captures these values when it starts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AxeClient.usageAttribution"},{"type":"text","text":"), and its usage-service events and session-init analytics"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event are all stamped from that one capture."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"A call that lands afterwards therefore applies to the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"next"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" session started in this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"process, never to one already running. There is no warning for a late call, because"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the process cannot tell a mistimed call apart from correct setup for the next session."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Unlike ","type":"text"},{"code":"declareProduct","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which ignores a conflicting second call, this is last write","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wins. The SDK appends the platform suffix, so pass ","type":"text"},{"code":"appium","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", not ","type":"text"},{"code":"appium-ios","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"productComponent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" that sanitizes to nothing leaves the previous value in place","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rather than clearing it; the ","type":"text"},{"code":"actor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" from the same call still applies.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axedevtoolsxcui\/axeintegration\/setusage(actor:productcomponent:)"]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axedevtoolsxcui\/axeintegration\/setusage(actor:productcomponent:)"]}],"ide